@read "package.json" path="name" label="pkg_name" visible="false" /

# {{ pkg_name }}: project state

Live-rendered from `.mdd/docs/*.md`, never hand-updated. Pass one or more
feature ids to scope this to just those features and their direct
dependency neighborhood: `livestage render project-state.stage --args
"17-source-directives"` or `--args "17-source-directives,18-compute-directives"`
for several. No `--args` at all renders the whole project.

@if args == ''
## Catalog

@list ".mdd/docs/*.md" fields="id,title,type,status,phase,tags,depends_on" | @render type="table" /

## Dependency graph

@graph target=".mdd/docs/*.md" format="mermaid" label="deps" /

Nodes: {{ deps._nodes }}. Edges: {{ deps._edges }}. Cycles: {{ deps._cycles }}. Broken edges: {{ deps._broken }}.

## Open work

@list ".mdd/docs/*.md" where="status != 'complete'" fields="id,title,status,phase" | @render type="table" /

## Open known issues

@list ".mdd/docs/*.md" where="known_issues.length > 0" fields="id,known_issues" | @render type="table" /

## Consumer-callable surfaces

@list ".mdd/docs/*.md" where="primitives.length > 0" fields="id,primitives" | @render type="table" /

## Test coverage gaps

@list ".mdd/docs/*.md" where="test_files.length == 0" fields="id,title" | @render type="table" /
@if-end

@if args != ''
## Scoped to: {{ args }}

### The target feature(s)

@list ".mdd/docs/*.md" where="args.split(',').includes(id)" fields="id,title,type,status,phase,tags,depends_on" | @render type="table" /

### What depends on them

@list ".mdd/docs/*.md" where="depends_on.some(d => args.split(',').includes(d))" fields="id,title,depends_on" | @render type="table" /

### Their own open known issues

@list ".mdd/docs/*.md" where="args.split(',').includes(id) && known_issues.length > 0" fields="id,known_issues" | @render type="table" /

### Their consumer-callable surfaces

@list ".mdd/docs/*.md" where="args.split(',').includes(id) && primitives.length > 0" fields="id,primitives" | @render type="table" /
@if-end
